WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.800
Gradebook Ghana: report cards in minutes, not weeks.

00:02.800 --> 00:08.100
Try the demo school. First, log in as an admin.

00:08.100 --> 00:11.200
The admin sets up the school: classes, subjects, teachers and students.

00:11.200 --> 00:14.300
Classes and subjects.

00:14.300 --> 00:18.000
The student list, with guardians and class.

00:18.000 --> 00:21.600
Now log in as a teacher.

00:21.600 --> 00:24.400
Each teacher sees their own subjects and classes.

00:24.400 --> 00:35.300
Enter class work and exam marks in a grid. The total, grade and class position update as you type.

00:35.300 --> 00:39.000
Save the marks.

00:39.000 --> 00:42.200
Publish them when they are ready, so students can see them.

00:42.200 --> 00:45.700
Rankings for the whole class are worked out for you.

00:45.700 --> 00:50.800
A student logs in with their index number.

00:50.800 --> 00:57.200
They see every subject, grade and their position in class.

00:57.200 --> 00:58.800
And they can download the report card as a PDF.
